leted":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.4.1 stable, 4.5 beta 1\n\n### System information\n\nVoid #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Sat Jun 21 02:19:00 UTC 2025 on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970 (nvidia; 570.169) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-7600K CPU @ 3.80GHz (4 threads) - 15.50 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nI'm not sure if this is intended but I think this is undesirable behaviour. If you use the background or sky for reflections in the ```WorldEnvironment```, fog is not factored in. If fog mostly obscures the sky then it makes background / sky reflections wildly inaccurate and pointless.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open mrp.\n- Enable / disable fog.\n- Notice that reflections don't change.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20878798/mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengin